     ($ sudo -n ... -> "sudo: a password is required"). `launchctl setenv DEVELOPER_DIR` + service
     kickstart were attempted and did not resolve it. UNIT tests run because they use the in-process
     CoreSimulator path; UITests require host-side `xcrun simctl` and therefore cannot launch.
   This affects the PRE-EXISTING TeslaSyncUITests bundle (LiveData/AppLaunch/Auth/Push) — NOT this widget.

